<!-- ============ SHEET 3 ============ -->
<h2>Sheet 3 — Lamp resistor block &amp; straps</h2>
<div class="sub">Wire-wound resistors feeding the RG and RF mast lamps, with the straps tying them together, matching your wire tags exactly.</div>
<svg viewBox="0 0 680 480" role="img">
